      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why i'm messaging you. i just feel like a ghost. everyone in my program, everyone i thought were my friends... they all just stopped talking to me. like i dont even exist anymore. it happened so fast and now i walk into the student lounge and it's like there's this huge wall of silence whenever i walk by. it's actually physically painful. i feel like i'm already dead, just walking around in a body.",
