      "content": "The pressure to reinvent yourself right now feels monumental, and it's okay to feel completely depleted by that thought. When the idea of starting fresh feels impossible, focus instead on finding small pockets of quiet refuge where you feel safe. If those feelings are becoming overwhelming, please reach out to a crisis line right now; they are there to listen without judgment. Your life and your existence matter, even when it feels like waiting for an ending.",
